WEBVTT

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:14.640
Thanks for your message.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:18.480
I was hoping to call you back when you were free to talk, but...

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.740
I'm sorry, I dozed off.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:29.570
I was up all night last night... but I guess that's not an excuse.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:33.100
Anyway, good luck with your job!

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:41.570
nemuri nasai ima wa tada

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:41.570
Sleep, for now

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:48.480
watashi no naka de doko ni mo ikanai de

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:48.480
Inside of me, and don't go anywhere

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:09.490
madoromi no fuchi de yureteru gunjou iro no yo

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:09.490
Through the slumbering ultramarine sky

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:15.010
majiwaru koto no nai hoshi wo sagashiteru

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:15.010
I am searching for stars that will never cross

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:22.710
anata wo motomeru yubisaki yami ni samayotte

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:22.710
These fingertips search for you, but are lost in darkness

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:31.590
mogaite mo nukedesenai ai no umi ni oboreteku

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:31.590
I try but I can't escape, and I drown in the sea of love

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:39.480
yawaranai toiki ni kokoro sae mo furueru

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:39.480
Your tender sigh makes my heart tremble

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:45.100
karamaru utsukushi kumo no ito no you

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:45.100
Seemingly entangled in the beautiful strands of a spider web

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:49.590
ugokenai no watashi wo yurushite

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:49.590
I cannot move, please forgive me

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:52.920
anata no ude ni dakarete nemuru

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:52.920
I am sleeping with your arms around me

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:56.140
nani mo kamo sutetatte ii

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:56.140
I don't mind losing anything else

00:01:56.140 --> 00:02:03.670
ii kono mama no maboroshi nante zukuru no wa yamete

00:01:56.140 --> 00:02:03.670
Stop pretending that you are a good girl

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:07.130
hontou no watashi wo mitsukete

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:07.130
Find the real me

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:13.210
zutto matteru

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:13.210
I'll be waiting forever

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:24.120
Uh, about yesterday-

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.720
Next one, please!

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:30.730
Page 21
I think I want to return 
to where the path forks.
I should have gone right, instead.
This journey has been filled
 with nothing but regret.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:39.770
Now you've really done it.

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:42.710
This painting is authentic, you know.

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:46.700
Is this what they call the "rock lifestyle"?

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:49.050
Or was it "punk"?

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:56.820
Even if you were to sell everything else, it wouldn't be worth even half of this one.

00:02:57.220 --> 00:03:01.080
Of course, you'll also need to pay the intermediary fees,

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.340
I'm just doing my job.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:07.510
I cannot guarantee whether this will be taken care of smoothly, but...

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:13.960
Please contact me directly for any future transactions.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:19.830
Knowing how emotional our own Miss Kanzaki is, I don't think she could let such hard-won treasures go to waste.

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:21.890
Oops, I was rude.

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:31.690
Good morning, I look forward to-

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:46.540
I look forward to working with you.

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:56.690
Wha-

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.820
What... is it?

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:08.720
I just want to confirm our plans from now on.

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:16.890
Tonight, we're broadcasting the Top 10 live!

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:19.330
And second place this week is...

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.290
Morikawa Yuki's "White Album"!

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:59.610
Excuse me, but where is the train station?

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.230
Where are you headed?

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:22.680
The hospital, please.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:24.470
And where shall we stop along the way?

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:34.150
She ran off again?!

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.720
Menou-san!

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.970
Menou-san, you're in there, aren't you?

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:10.660
Please come out!

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.350
I know you can hear me!

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.910
Just open up!

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:16.070
Menou-san, Menou-san!

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:19.810
I'll explain things to the President!

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:28.840
What is it? Did something good happen?

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:30.910
Why do you say that?

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.080
You're overly animated.

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:41.080
Yuki-san visited this afternoon.

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:43.630
Really.

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:57.200
I haven't seen Sawakura-san recently.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.540
Get used to being alone, by yourself!

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:03.280
Geez, think about who you are, you horny-

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:04.260
It's fine.

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:08.070
This is fine.

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:16.010
Touya, I have something to tell you.

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:18.010
I'll listen tomorrow.

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:20.010
You're composing test problems again?

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:25.740
No, I'm planning the schedule for February 28th.

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.170
What's happening then?

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:30.350
Will it be the day of my memorial service?

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:33.540
That's right, make sure you die as scheduled,

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:35.980
so that you don't inconvenience anyone.

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:37.880
And seriously, stop it.

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:45.490
Touya, Yuki-san...

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:46.810
Did you say something?

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:48.990
No.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:14.390
Good afternoon.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.760
It seems like I had a dream.

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:25.150
You were fast asleep, so I decided to...

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:26.750
I'm sorry.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:29.650
I see, it's the coming-of-age ceremony?

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.540
It's that time of year already, huh.

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:34.660
This is for a photoshoot, though.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:37.600
The photos will be taken in a garden somewhere.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:40.070
Looks like idols have it hard, too.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.490
What about Touya-kun?

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:44.060
He's still a kid.

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:46.180
We can't celebrate his coming-of-age ceremony.

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:47.380
That's...

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:10.010
What admirable passion!

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:14.700
For you to be taking so many worthless risks...

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.110
W... Who are you?

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.790
I'm a journalist.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:23.110
You want to continue doing this illegally?

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:24.260
Or...

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:31.930
Are you some sort of moron?!

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:34.110
You only took photos of the manager and some guy...

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:37.450
Why didn't you take any of Morikawa Yuki?

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:40.160
Yuki-chan didn't do anything wrong.

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:40.890
Huh?

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:43.880
I don't want to hurt Yuki-chan.

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:46.010
You want me to stab you too?!

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:47.550
Ah ow ow ow...

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:51.250
So... you stabbed a woman?

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:53.530
Yeah, I did.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.690
She was screwing around with me, it had to be done.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.490
You weren't caught?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:00.170
Obviously not, like I'd mess up that badly!

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:04.860
That bitch was walking around fine the next day, though.

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:07.010
What the hell is her body made of?

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.580
In any case, listen up.

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:14.150
About being a press cameraman...

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:15.630
Yes...

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.340
So, you finally decided to come back!

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:01.760
That girl is absolutely useless without you around!

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:06.230
She has no idea when the songs'll be ready, and there's also the release deadlines...

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:07.430
Hey, Menou!

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:13.800
Okay, we're going to finish two songs tonight!

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:15.070
Can you handle that?

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:19.710
I'm counting on you, Menou.

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:21.640
I need you to get into the Top 10.

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:30.520
Did you go to the coming-of-age ceremony?

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:33.890
But, I was with you...

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:35.500
I guess, now that you mention it.

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.280
Was it good?

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:41.350
I've forgotten whether it was good or not.

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:44.920
I just remember there were lots of dressed-up girls.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:46.710
Did Yuki go?

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:47.360
No idea.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.830
Have you been seeing Yuki lately?

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:52.740
No.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:56.750
That's because... now...

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.060
I see.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:04.490
If we knew Yuki's schedule, I could give you some time off to-

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:07.280
Let's not talk about Yuki during work.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:08.130
Ah.

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:10.620
I guess you're right. Sorry.

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:17.900
Somehow

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:18.690
she seems happy

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:23.900
Since both of us were busy, we totally forgot.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:26.090
The two of us burst out laughing.

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:29.780
You went to the coming-of-age ceremony, didn't you, Yuki?

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:32.660
Show me a picture of you all dressed up next time we meet.

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:33.080
Bye.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:37.060
A present?

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:42.050
It's your birthday this Sunday, isn't it?

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:44.300
I don't know whether we'll see each other then,

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:46.010
since we both have our own things to do...

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:48.780
Why are you doing this?

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:52.930
Why? I mean, you gave me a present on Christmas Eve...

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:54.600
That was for Yuki-chan.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:56.940
Besides, you paid me back.

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:58.350
That's not what I'm talking about.

00:12:58.350 --> 00:13:03.280
I-I said, I was thinking of giving that to a friend...

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:04.970
What do you want me to say?

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:09.140
Geez, I'll take it just so it doesn't go to waste.

00:13:10.820 --> 00:13:12.060
Thanks.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:15.160
Is it okay if I don't open it now?

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.000
Eh?

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:19.940
Ah, you can open it later.

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:22.460
What are you standing there for?

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.550
Isn't it about time you told me?

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:29.550
About what?

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:31.550
Which schools you're applying to.

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:34.000
You sent out your applications already, right?

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:36.670
You don't have much time left...

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:42.310
It's also about time for me to think about what you want to become and come up with a study plan...

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:45.820
I don't know, I can't hear you, and I'm not telling you!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:46.650
Right.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:51.190
Now then, after all the commercials, we're finally broadcasting the Top 3 of this week!

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:55.370
In first place last week was Ogata Rina's "Sound of Destiny".

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:59.550
Now, will the recently transferred Idol Queen retain her number one spot?

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:03.040
Or will her ex-sister, who is rapidly rising in popularity, Morikawa Yuki-

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:05.190
You wanted to hear the rest?

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:10.590
Not really. If you can concentrate better this way, then...

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:12.160
So you're interested!

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:13.760
I'm not.

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:14.550
Obviously

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:14.550
I am

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.770
Have you seen Yuki recently?

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:20.310
about Ogata Rina

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:19.980
Nope, she's been really busy recently.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:24.690
Ah, Rina- ... san, she hired me again.

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:27.610
Aesop's delusions are as obstinate as ever, aren't they?

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:32.100
Lesson 4, Chapter 1.

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:34.070
Are you all right, sir?

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:37.250
Better ask my nurse.

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:39.870
My English is not good enough for me to know.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:44.880
The daughter of mine seems to be knocking them.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:47.610
Called a lot of them before hard time, doesn't she?

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:59.640
Mana, is the tutor h-

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:09.480
So you must be... Fujii... sensei.

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:14.570
I see. I see how it is.

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:16.140
Seems like you knew all along.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:20.830
It's rare for her to study for this long,

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:23.460
so I was wondering just how great this new tutor was.

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:28.030
Hmph. What are the two of you doing in broad daylight?

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:30.300
I'm properly-

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:31.630
Did you tell Mana?

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:32.660
No...

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:36.010
That you followed Ogata Rina to my production company.

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:39.680
And you're dating Morikawa Yuki-

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:38.930
President-

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:40.720
Liar.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.230
Mana-chan, look...

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:43.060
Liar.

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:43.830
Looks true to me.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:44.640
Liar.

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:45.770
Didn't I tell you from the start-

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:46.520
Shut up.

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:47.900
Mana...

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:48.980
Shut up.

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:49.900
Shut up.

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:52.930
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:59.660
If you goddamn adults just keep doing whatever the hell you want...

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:07.640
Do you really think I can concentrate on my exams?!

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:10.750
Mana, stop-

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:12.360
Die.

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:15.090
Mana.

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:19.640
All of you assholes, die, die!

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:22.220
Mana, mama's getting mad!

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:25.390
Shut up, get out, get out!

00:16:25.390 --> 00:16:26.390
You...

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:28.940
Get out of the way, you hag!

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:40.370
She called me a hag.

00:16:41.490 --> 00:16:44.580
A hag... since when did she learn such a word...

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:46.960
Fujii-kun.

00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:48.170
Y-Yes.

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:49.750
Do something.

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:50.790
Do something?

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:52.630
This is the responsibility of the teacher, is it not?

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:55.130
I need to leave immediately.

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:10.550
I think Haruka-sensei will do something about it.

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:13.470
That's enough!

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:15.930
I keep having to wipe your ass behind you.

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:18.280
What are you treating your parents as?

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:21.850
I don't want you to watch out for me for the rest of my life...

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:25.830
Do you have any idea how much money the girl you laid your hands on extorted from us?

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.830
Really...

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:29.580
What's more, you got her pregnant!

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.540
I couldn't help it!

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:32.460
Is it trauma?

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:34.920
Is it because what you wanted to keep was too much for you?

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:35.840
Hmph!

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:39.300
How much longer are you going to keep acting all mushy like a little kid?!

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:41.330
I told you to give it up.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:44.350
Political marriages are no longer popular.

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:46.600
Dealings with the wealthy can only lead to disaster!

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:49.440
And what's worse, that girl's nothing but some crazy bitch.

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:52.980
No way, never will I allow some loose celebrity into our house.

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:54.760
It would be the ultimate shame of our family!

00:17:55.070 --> 00:18:00.680
But... I forgot about her a long time ago!

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:02.870
Hmph.

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:15.170
Dad?

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:16.240
Does it hurt?

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:46.060
You'll be singing to your own accompaniment for this song.

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:47.540
Yes.

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:49.730
You'll be the one playing this, Yuki.

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:51.120
Yes.

00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:05.410
Yuki-san.

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:08.260
You have a call from President Kanzaki.

00:19:23.150 --> 00:19:26.280
This is Kanzaki. Please call me at my home.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.160
This is Kanzaki. Please contact me.

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:42.340
This is Rina. I just received a call from President Kanzaki.

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:46.340
The way she spoke, it's as if she expected you to be with me.

00:19:49.470 --> 00:19:55.190
This is Yuki. I just received a call from President Kanzaki of M3 Productions.

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:58.150
She said she couldn't reach you.

00:19:58.150 --> 00:20:03.490
I was in the middle of a lesson, so I said sorry and hung up.

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:05.990
Maybe I should've told her the hospital's number...

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:08.660
This is Kanzaki.

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:24.420
Hello? This is Fujii.

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:26.590
Where the hell were you loitering around all night?!

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:29.010
I'm sorry.

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:30.970
Mana still hasn't returned home.

00:20:32.470 --> 00:20:34.350
Is she with that Haruka girl?

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:36.040
Do you know where she is?

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:39.520
I don't want to call the police.

00:20:39.520 --> 00:20:40.770
You understand, don't you?

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:45.430
Now that you mention it, when we met at Echoes,

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:48.720
they said they were going to camp out together for New Year's...

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:53.180
You know how Haruka used to camp out with her brother a lot?

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:10.010
Hello?

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:14.180
Tamaru... kun.

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:26.740
This is Hiiragi.

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:28.110
State your business.

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:32.480
I can't over the phone... I need to talk to you face-to-face.

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:37.620
Understood.

00:21:58.230 --> 00:21:59.940
Please wait here.

00:22:33.220 --> 00:22:34.300
Haruka

00:22:36.100 --> 00:22:39.980
She's reborn

00:22:49.410 --> 00:22:55.950
watashi ni itsumo anata wa yasashii

00:22:49.410 --> 00:22:55.950
You have always been kind to me

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:02.520
sono yasashisa ga fuan ni suru

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:02.520
But this kindness makes me insecure

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:11.360
unmei no ito hodokenai you ni

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:11.360
This string of fate, I'll retie it over and over

00:23:12.430 --> 00:23:17.970
nando mo musubi naoshite

00:23:12.430 --> 00:23:17.970
So that it will never come loose

00:23:19.170 --> 00:23:26.340
tsugi ni au yakusoku dekinai mama

00:23:19.170 --> 00:23:26.340
I don't want to hear you say goodbye

00:23:27.640 --> 00:23:36.290
wakare no kotoba mada kikitaku wa nai yo

00:23:27.640 --> 00:23:36.290
Until we make promises to meet again

00:23:36.620 --> 00:23:44.030
aenai yoru ni yume de aetara

00:23:36.620 --> 00:23:44.030
Even if we can't meet tonight, 
if I can see you in my dreams

00:23:44.430 --> 00:23:51.940
ashita ga tsurakute mo waratte irareru

00:23:44.430 --> 00:23:51.940
Even if tomorrow is difficult I'll be able to smile

00:23:51.940 --> 00:23:59.410
donna ni tooku hanarete ite mo

00:23:51.940 --> 00:23:59.410
No matter how far apart we may become

00:23:59.680 --> 00:24:09.390
tsunagatte ireru to shinjite iru

00:23:59.680 --> 00:24:09.390
I believe that we will still be connected together

00:24:21.950 --> 00:24:23.160
Page 22

00:24:24.290 --> 00:24:26.120
Troubled that you are a poor speaker?

00:24:26.120 --> 00:24:28.250
Try conversing with your eyes,

00:24:28.250 --> 00:24:30.210
you'll want to talk soon enough.

00:24:30.880 --> 00:24:32.000
White Album.
